flowchart LR
    Patient[Patient]
    Doctor[Doctor]
    Receptionist[Receptionist]
    Admin[Administrator]

    P1((1.0 User Authentication))
    P2((2.0 Doctor and Availability Management))
    P3((3.0 Appointment Management))
    P4((4.0 Medical Records Management))
    P5((5.0 Billing and Reporting))

    D1[(D1 User Data)]
    D2[(D2 Doctor and Availability Data)]
    D3[(D3 Appointment Data)]
    D4[(D4 Medical and Billing Data)]

    Patient -->|Login credentials| P1
    Doctor -->|Login credentials| P1
    Receptionist -->|Login credentials| P1
    Admin -->|Login credentials| P1
    P1 <--> D1
    P1 -->|Session token and access result| Patient
    P1 -->|Session token and access result| Doctor
    P1 -->|Session token and access result| Receptionist
    P1 -->|Session token and access result| Admin

    Patient -->|Doctor search request| P2
    Doctor -->|Availability information| P2
    Admin -->|Doctor configuration| P2
    P2 <--> D2
    P2 -->|Doctor list and available slots| Patient
    P2 -->|Doctor list and available slots| Receptionist

    Patient -->|Booking or cancellation request| P3
    Receptionist -->|Appointment scheduling request| P3
    Doctor -->|Appointment status update| P3
    P3 <--> D3
    P3 -->|Appointment confirmation and status| Patient
    P3 -->|Appointment schedule| Doctor
    P3 -->|Appointment schedule| Receptionist

    Doctor -->|Diagnosis, notes, and prescriptions| P4
    Patient -->|Medical-history request| P4
    P4 <--> D3
    P4 <--> D4
    P4 -->|Medical records and prescriptions| Patient
    P4 -->|Patient history| Doctor

    Receptionist -->|Invoice and payment information| P5
    Patient -->|Invoice request| P5
    Admin -->|Report request| P5
    P5 <--> D3
    P5 <--> D4
    P5 -->|Invoice and billing status| Patient
    P5 -->|Billing result| Receptionist
    P5 -->|Operational report| Admin

    classDef external fill:#E8F1FB,stroke:#1F4E79,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#102A43;
    classDef process fill:#FFF2CC,stroke:#BF9000,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#4A3B00;
    classDef store fill:#F4CCCC,stroke:#990000,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#4A0000;
    class Patient,Doctor,Receptionist,Admin external;
    class P1,P2,P3,P4,P5 process;
    class D1,D2,D3,D4 store;